# Learning roadmap: canonical + mirrors (keep in sync)

The 8-week internship learning roadmap lives in three places. The **canonical**
(only-edit) copy is `study_docs/learning-roadmap.md`. The other two are **read-only
mirrors**: `.cursor/learning-roadmap.md` and the Claude Code plan file
(`~/.claude/plans/rocm-libraries-repo-familiar-starry-aurora.md`).

- Always edit `study_docs/learning-roadmap.md`, never a mirror.
